<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96147" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στᾰδ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάδην</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>standing erect</i> or
				<i>upright</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς ς</span>., in
			act to hurl his bolt, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				513
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχη ς</span>. pikes <i>for
				close fight</i>, opp. missiles (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάδιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.1
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				240
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. σῶμα</span>
			<i>firm, steady</i>, of the cube, Ti. 
				Locr.
			<i><span class="en">
				98c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάθος βραδὺκαὶ ς</span>., of
			water, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.Quint.
				2.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταδαία πάλη, μάχη</span>,
			prob.l. in <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VS</u>
				1.22.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				6.2.6
			</span></i>, for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταδιαία; μάχη ς</span>.
				v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.38
			</span></i>, for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταδία</span>.</div>
